<titlePage type="main"><docTitle><titlePart type="main"> <hi rendition="#g"><hi rendition="#b">Die Ent&#x017F;tehung</hi><lb/>
der<lb/>
<hi rendition="#b">Volkswirt&#x017F;chaft.</hi></hi></titlePart><lb/>
